From: yah <yah@localhost>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 17:50:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 02/73] 0005-gfx1151-f16-wmma-operand-placement

Qualify the f16 WMMA (v_wmma_f32_16x16x16_f16, wave32, gfx1151) for matrix-operand register placement (#1160), which
upstream enables for bf16 only: spreads each WMMA's operands over the register banks. Prefill GEMM cycles -2.6%, bit-identical.

(cherry picked from commit 2c8c74f0c9cb1794b20e91ec24c4581d982cda3a)
---
 loom/py/loom/target/arch/amdgpu/descriptors/matrix.py | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/loom/py/loom/target/arch/amdgpu/descriptors/matrix.py b/loom/py/loom/target/arch/amdgpu/descriptors/matrix.py
index 36244de88f..c59a6c44b9 100644
--- a/loom/py/loom/target/arch/amdgpu/descriptors/matrix.py
+++ b/loom/py/loom/target/arch/amdgpu/descriptors/matrix.py
@@ -27,6 +27,7 @@ from .common import *
 MATRIX_OPERAND_PLACEMENT_QUALIFICATIONS = (
     ("gfx1100", 32, "amdgpu.v_wmma_f32_16x16x16_bf16"),
     ("gfx1151", 32, "amdgpu.v_wmma_f32_16x16x16_bf16"),
+    ("gfx1151", 32, "amdgpu.v_wmma_f32_16x16x16_f16"),
 )
 
 _WMMA_GFX11_WAVE64_ACCUMULATOR_SIZE_REASON = "gfx11-wave64-wmma-half-width-accumulator"
